Maintainer: Egill Fridgeirsson <e.fridgeirsson@erasmusmc.nl>
Description: Provides deep learning models for patient-level prediction using
    observational health data mapped to the Observational Medical Outcomes
    Partnership Common Data Model. Integrates with the
    'PatientLevelPrediction' framework and uses 'PyTorch' through 'reticulate'
    to fit and evaluate multilayer perceptrons, residual networks, transformers,
    and RealMLP models. The prediction framework is described in Reps et al.
    (2018) <doi:10.1093/jamia/ocy032>. Python dependencies are required only
    when fitting or applying these models.
